# Commands that read, copy or send a file's content (credential-guard, packs/README.md "Credential files").
# A credential path given to one of these is blocked; given to any other command (ssh -i, kubectl --kubeconfig,
# docker --env-file, source, ls, chmod) it is a use and passes.
# One per line: '<command>' or '<command> <word>' (a reader only when <word> is one of its arguments).
# Remove a line if it gets in the way of daily work; add one when a new reader shows up. Packs add theirs in
# packs/<name>/credential-readers.

